        "kind": "message",
        "task_id": "offsite",
        "chat_id": "main",
        "message": "I need you to arrange our team offsite: 12 people at Harbor Loft, a full day with lunch. It is pencilled in on the team calendar for Thursday 3 December, 09:00 to 17:00 (+04:00). Harbor Loft stops taking enquiries for that week an hour from now, so ask them for a quote in the venue chat before then; they can take a day or so to answer. Book the day in the shop if it costs 250000 cents or less, and nothing beyond the venue day itself. I want to okay the payment myself, so tell me the price first. Marek is collecting the team's availability and the final headcount and will email you. Keep the team calendar right. Once the day is booked and you have Marek's final headcount, add a record to the offsite collection with item_id (the shop item you booked) and headcount, and email Priya one summary with subject Offsite booked. Leave every other order, event and record alone."
      },
      {
        "at": 1,
        "kind": "status"
      }
    ],
